The '''wife''' of [[Jarek Yeager]] was a [[Gender|female]] [[human]]. At some point, she was photographed with her [[Marriage|husband]] and [[Jarek Yeager's daughter|daughter]] on [[Batuu]].<ref name="Fuel for the Fire" /> Around ten [[Standard year|years]] prior to the start of the [[First Order-Resistance War]], she and her daughter attended a race that Yeager and his brother, [[Marcus Speedstar]], were competing in. In order to beat Yeager, Speedstar used large amounts of [[coaxium]] to fuel his ship, but during the race, the ship combusted and crashed, killing her and her daughter. Following this incident, Yeager became estranged from his brother for over ten years.<ref name="TPC">{{Resistance|The Platform Classic}}</ref>

